---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SchemaOrg from '../../components/SchemaOrg.astro';
import { business } from '../../data/business';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Web Design Colmar | Delivered in 7 days, from €490"
  description="Custom websites for businesses in Colmar and the Haut-Rhin. Fast, visible on Google, built to convert. 30+ sites delivered in Alsace. Free quote within 24h."
  lang="en"
  frPath="/creation-site-web-colmar"
  enPath="/en/web-design-colmar"
>
  <SchemaOrg type="localBusiness" />

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="relative w-full bg-[#0D0D0D] px-6 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, white 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-[20%] right-[10%] w-[400px] h-[400px] rounded-full bg-[var(--color-accent)] opacity-[0.08] blur-[120px]"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl z-10">
      <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--color-accent)]">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full" style="background-color: #E86C47;"></span>
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Colmar &middot; Haut-Rhin &middot; Alsace</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-5xl">
        Web Design in Colmar
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-neutral-300 md:text-xl max-w-2xl">
        Custom websites for shops, craftspeople and hospitality businesses in Colmar and across the Haut-Rhin. Built to rank locally, built to convert tourists, built to be fast.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a href="/en/order-starter-site/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-accent)] px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[var(--color-accent-hover)] hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          Get a free quote
        </a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-8 py-4 font-semibold text-white/85 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/10">
          View my work
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTEXT -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[var(--color-bg)] px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <div class="grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-2 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-[var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Colmar: 3 million yearly visitors, and your competitors already have a site</h2>
          <p>Colmar welcomes more than 3 million visitors a year, locals aside. Yet many shopkeepers and craftspeople in town either have no website or run an outdated WordPress from 2015.</p>
          <p>The reality today: tourists search on Google before they arrive ("restaurant Colmar", "craftsman Colmar", "hairdresser Colmar"). Locals do the same before walking through your door. Without a site, you're invisible to those searches, including AI tools like ChatGPT and Perplexity. Competitors with a modern site pick up those clients instead.</p>
          <p>In Alsace, cross-border traffic is an asset. A bilingual FR/DE or FR/EN site captures German and Swiss visitors that your competitors ignore. A well-ranked modern site is your storefront 24/7, for locals, tourists and cross-border travellers alike.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">What you get</h2>
          {[
            { title: "Custom design", desc: "Tailored to your business, your tone, your clients. Alsatian feel on request." },
            { title: "Local SEO for Colmar & Haut-Rhin", desc: "Google Maps, localised keywords, structured data." },
            { title: "AI search ready", desc: "ChatGPT, Perplexity and Claude can actually cite you." },
            { title: "Mobile-first", desc: "Most tourists search on their phone. Your site is built for that first." },
            { title: "Lighthouse 100", desc: "Loads in under a second, on any connection." },
            { title: "Bilingual options", desc: "FR/DE or FR/EN available for cross-border and tourism." },
          ].map(({ title, desc }) => (
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-bg-alt)] p-4">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 text-[var(--color-accent-text)]" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <div>
                <div class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]">{title}</div>
                <div class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">{desc}</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHO I WORK WITH -->
  <section class="w-full bg-white px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Who I build sites for in Colmar and Alsace</h2>
      <p class="mb-10 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Typical situations, typical outcomes.</p>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-border)] p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">A local shop</h3>
            <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">Retail</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-4">
              <p class="font-semibold text-red-700 mb-1">Before</p>
              <p class="text-red-600">A Facebook page, no website. Passers-by find you, nobody else does.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 p-4">
              <p class="font-semibold text-emerald-700 mb-1">After</p>
              <p class="text-emerald-600">Catalogue, opening hours, map and online order form. Clients find you on Google, not just by walking past.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-border)] p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">A holiday rental or guesthouse</h3>
            <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-700">Tourism</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-4">
              <p class="font-semibold text-red-700 mb-1">Before</p>
              <p class="text-red-600">A dated site with blurry photos, no direct booking. Everything goes through Booking and their commission.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 p-4">
              <p class="font-semibold text-emerald-700 mb-1">After</p>
              <p class="text-emerald-600">Room carousel, gallery, guest reviews. Bookings come through your site, not Booking.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-border)] p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">A wellness practitioner</h3>
            <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-teal-700">Wellness</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-4">
              <p class="font-semibold text-red-700 mb-1">Before</p>
              <p class="text-red-600">Instagram only and word-of-mouth. New clients plateau.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-100 p-4">
              <p class="font-semibold text-emerald-700 mb-1">After</p>
              <p class="text-emerald-600">Class schedule, pricing, online booking. New people find you on Google.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[var(--color-bg)] px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="mb-10 text-center text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3">
        {[
          {
            q: "You're not based in Colmar. Does that matter?",
            a: "Not really. Everything happens remotely: scoping call by phone or video, back-and-forth by email and WhatsApp. Same result as a local agency, often faster and cheaper."
          },
          {
            q: "Can you build a bilingual site in French and German?",
            a: "Yes. FR/DE or FR/EN bilingual sites are a real fit for tourism and cross-border businesses in Alsace. Content is translated and localised, not run through Google Translate. Useful if you serve German or Swiss clients."
          },
          {
            q: "My business is seasonal (Christmas market, summer tourism). Is that an issue?",
            a: "No. Your site stays live all year (hosting included). You can update hours and news yourself via the editing panel. No need to take the site down off-season."
          },
          {
            q: "Can you rebuild an old WordPress or Wix site?",
            a: "Yes, very often. I carry over your content, your domain, and redirect the old site to the new one to keep your Google ranking. Result: faster, more secure, no monthly subscriptions."
          },
          {
            q: "How does your pricing compare to a Colmar agency?",
            a: "My Starter Site is €490, delivered in 7 days. Local agencies typically charge €2,000 to €5,000 for a comparable result, over 4 to 8 weeks. Same technical standard, single point of contact, you own the site outright."
          },
          {
            q: "I'm a healthcare or wellness professional. Is that a fit?",
            a: "Yes. Osteopaths, physios, psychologists, yoga, sophrology. I build sober, professional sites that respect your deontological obligations. Online booking available as an add-on."
          }
        ].map(({ q, a }, i) => (
          <details class="group rounded-xl bg-white p-6 border border-[var(--color-border)] hover:shadow-sm transition-all" open={i === 0}>
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-3 font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">
              <span>{q}</span>
              <svg class="h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 14l-7 7m0 0l-7-7m7 7V3" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">{a}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRICING SUMMARY -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[var(--color-bg-alt)] px-6 py-16 md:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">Transparent pricing</h2>
      <p class="mb-8 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">One product, one price. Bespoke work on request.</p>
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        {business.offers.map((offer) => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-white p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
            <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--color-accent-text)]">{offer.price ? `€${offer.price.toLocaleString()}` : 'On request'}</div>
            <div class="mt-1 font-bold text-[var(--color-text)]">{offer.name}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <a href="/en/services" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent-text)] hover:underline">
        Full pricing details &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FURTHER READING -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[var(--color-bg)] px-6 py-12 md:px-8 md:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <a
        href="/en/blog/build-business-website-grand-est-guide"
        data-umami-event="geo-pillar-link"
        data-umami-event-ville="colmar"
        class="group block rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-bg-alt)] p-6 md:p-8 transition-all hover:border-[var(--color-accent)] hover:shadow-md"
      >
        <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--color-accent-text)]">Further reading</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold leading-snug text-[var(--color-text)] md:text-2xl">
          Building your business website in the Grand Est: the practical guide
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          The real steps, the actual costs, the timeline, and what changes when you run a small business in Colmar. A complete guide, no jargon.
        </p>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent-text)]">
          Read the guide
          <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">&rarr;</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="w-full bg-[#0D0D0D] px-6 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-white">Ready to launch your Colmar site?</h2>
      <a href="/en/order-starter-site/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-10 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E86C47, #D4572F); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(232, 108, 71, 0.3);">
        Order my site for €490
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
